uuu_version 1.4.182

# Write a whole Torizon SD image to the i.MX 6SoloX SABRE-SD through the
# board itself, over uuu.
#
# NOT `uuu -b sd_all`. That built-in ends with `flash bootloader`, a
# command that exists only in NXP's FSL_FASTBOOT extensions and that
# this board's mainline U-Boot does not implement. `flash all` (the
# other command it issues) does work on this board -- its fastboot
# config names the "all" user-area alias -- but `sd_all` never reaches
# it: it also sets `mmcdev`/`fastboot_dev` and does `mmc dev ${sd_dev}`,
# none of which steer where fastboot writes. That is
# CONFIG_FASTBOOT_FLASH_MMC_DEV, fixed at compile time, and `sd_dev` is
# not even defined outside NXP's manufacturing environment.
#
# So: load U-Boot over the boot ROM's serial-download protocol, then
# write the whole card in one fastboot transaction. The bootloader needs
# no separate write because the image already carries it at the 1 KiB
# offset.
#
# THE uuu_version LINE ABOVE IS LOAD-BEARING; do not lower it. Two
# independent defects make an older uuu fail on this board, and the
# second is invisible until the first is fixed:
#
#   1. uuu's compiled-in fastboot device table gained 1fc9:0152 -- this
#      board's fastboot gadget -- only on 2021-12-13. An older uuu
#      matches no device and waits here forever.
#   2. Before 2021-10-06, uuu's flash command issued `getvar
#      logical-block-size` unconditionally and aborted when it failed.
#      U-Boot has never implemented that variable, on any version, so
#      an older uuu aborts before writing a byte.
#
# uuu_1.4.182 is the first release carrying both fixes; declaring it here
# makes an older uuu refuse with "This version of uuu is too old" instead
# of hanging or aborting obscurely.
#
# Run this whole script against the board with:
#   uuu imx6sxsabresd.uuu
# With more than one NXP device attached, pin the target by its USB path
# (read from `uuu -lsusb` while the board is in the serial downloader --
# it prints the port chain without dots, e.g. "3:653", not "3:6.5.3"):
#   uuu -m <bus:port> imx6sxsabresd.uuu

SDP: boot -f u-boot.imx
FB: flash -raw2sparse all torizon-docker-imx6sxsabresd.wic
FB: done
